WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.139
Step 1. Open Patient Home.

1.2
00:00:02.139 --> 00:00:07.662
Find the patient with Search patients and select the patient in the results.

1.3
00:00:07.662 --> 00:00:14.049
If Care shows Verify Patient Identity, enter the year of birth and select Verify.

2.1
00:00:14.049 --> 00:00:16.262
Step 2. Use the quick actions.

2.2
00:00:16.262 --> 00:00:21.628
Patient Home offers quick actions, and your permissions control which ones appear.

2.3
00:00:21.628 --> 00:00:26.513
Select Schedule Appointment to book an appointment for the patient.

3.1
00:00:26.513 --> 00:00:29.513
Step 3. View the patient's appointments.

3.2
00:00:29.513 --> 00:00:32.883
Patient Home shows the Upcoming Appointment card.

3.3
00:00:32.883 --> 00:00:38.177
The Appointments tab lists the appointments at this facility, under Upcoming,

3.4
00:00:38.177 --> 00:00:39.984
Past and Cancelled.

4.1
00:00:39.984 --> 00:00:44.109
Step 5. View the patient's appointments at every facility.

4.2
00:00:44.109 --> 00:00:49.522
Open the patient's profile and select its Appointments tab; each appointment also

4.3
00:00:49.522 --> 00:00:53.564
shows its facility. Select an appointment to open it.
